%%{init: {'theme':'default', 'flowchart': {'nodeSpacing': 35, 'rankSpacing': 28}}}%%
flowchart TD
    Start([CSP user is on a different SIM · signal or battery issues]) --> Dial[Dials the Wiom IVR Masked number from the unregistered SIM]
    Dial --> NotKnown[IVR doesn't recognise the phone number]
    NotKnown --> Ask[IVR asks for the 6-digit PIN to authenticate]
    Ask --> Enter[CSP reads the PIN from the CSP App ticket card or SMS<br/>Enters it on the keypad]
    Enter --> Check{PIN correct?}
    Check -->|Yes| Bridge[Bridges to the customer for that ticket]
    Bridge --> Pick{Customer picks up?}
    Pick -->|Yes| Connect[Both parties talk · Call recorded]
    Pick -->|No| Missed[CSP hears 'call not picked']
    Check -->|No| Retry[Wrong PIN audio · Allowed one more try<br/>2nd wrong → call ends]

    classDef start fill:#e0e7ff,stroke:#4338ca,color:#312e81
    classDef good fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d
    classDef neutral fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f
    classDef bad fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d
    class Start start
    class Connect good
    class Missed neutral
    class Retry bad
